    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「せんぱ〜いっ！　お弁当忘れたんですって？　わたしのでよければお裾分けしますよ〜っ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「あ、何ですかその顔は。今回はだいじょうぶですよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「なぜかわたしが全力でつくるとお弁当の容器が溶けたりするので、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「ちょっと気をつけてつくりましたから！　ふつうに食べられると思いますよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「おとなり、失礼しますね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「えへへ、先輩はここで日向ぼっこですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「え？　つゆり先輩が救護テントに辿りつくまでに倒れたから、運んできて体力を使い果たしたんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「それはまぁ……お疲れさまです、先輩♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「じゃあ、先輩お疲れのようですから、食べさせてあげますね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「はい、あ〜ん♪　って何で避けるんですか先輩っ、食べても死にませんよべつに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「うわ〜んっ、先輩が意地悪です！　心に傷を負いましたっ、保健委員でも治せない傷をっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「え？　冗談ですか〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
