  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「すこぉしで、いいんです。成長した証をください、ご褒美っぽいものを♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「わひゃ!?　な、何で顔を近づけてくるんですか！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「あっ、エッチなことを考えましたね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「そういうんじゃなくて、頭を撫で撫でするとかですよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「あるいは、ここにわたしが全力でつくったお弁当がありますので、それを食べてくれるとかがいいです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「え？　あぁ、そうですよ。がんばりすぎないようにするとストレス溜まっちゃうので、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「それを発散するために、ありったけ気合をいれたお弁当もつくったんですよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「早く食べてくれないと、合金製のお弁当箱が溶けちゃいます。あっ、垂れてる垂れてるっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「気をつけて、目に入ったらよぉく洗わないと失明しちゃいますよ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-bloomer",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bloomer_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「え？　これはもはやお弁当じゃない？」"
